---
/** Not found.
 *
 * Reached two ways: a mistyped URL, and any WordPress URL nobody thought of
 * when the redirect map was built. The second is the one that matters, so this
 * page's job is to put every section one click away rather than apologise.
 *
 * Served by Apache/LiteSpeed via `ErrorDocument 404`, emitted into
 * `public/.htaccess` by scripts/build-redirects.mjs.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const DESTINATIONS = [
  { href: '/sessions/', label: 'Online sessions', note: 'Every meetup we have held, with its recording.' },
  { href: '/heuristics/', label: 'Heuristics', note: 'The curated collection — search it by type or tag.' },
  { href: '/facilitating-archdes/', label: 'Facilitating Stories', note: 'Writing on facilitating software architecture & design.' },
  { href: '/open-space/', label: 'Open Space', note: 'Our open space events.' },
  { href: '/ddd-crew/', label: 'ddd crew', note: 'Community tools and canvases, republished.' },
  { href: '/podcasts/', label: 'Podcasts', note: 'Every session as an episode.' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Page not found — Virtual DDD"
  description="That page is not here. Every section of Virtual DDD is one click away."
  noindex
>
  <div class="wrap page">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--pink">404</p>
    <h1>That page is not here</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The link may be old, or we may have moved something. Nothing is lost —
      here is everything the site holds.
    </p>

    <ul class="dests">
      {DESTINATIONS.map((d) => (
        <li>
          <a href={d.href}>{d.label}</a>
          <span>{d.note}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <p class="ask">
      Still cannot find it? Ask in <a href="https://discord.gg/tRJkcsFDKN">our Discord</a> —
      someone will know where it went.
    </p>
  </div>

  <style>
    .page { max-width: var(--content-width); padding-block: var(--space-12); }
    .dests { list-style: none; margin: var(--space-10) 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: var(--space-4); }
    .dests li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-1); border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border); padding-left: var(--space-4); }
    .dests a { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; font-size: var(--text-lg); }
    .dests span { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: var(--text-sm); }
    .ask { margin-top: var(--space-10); color: var(--color-text-muted); }
    @media (min-width: 800px) {
      .dests { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--space-6) var(--space-8); }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
